{"description":"We are Austracervinitos, young explorers trying to complete the NASA's challenge, we do this project by the english class of our school.","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/ChatGPT_Image_23_sept_2026_11_30_1.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.png","summary":"Our first ideas were to do a story located in the Moon, about the astronauts. But we were more interested in making a story about Opportunity, the rover who breaked the expectatives. To start, we made the story in the document, and left it as it was. But some ideas start coming to us to put our story on a canva, and illustrate it with images and designs. We decided to make some original characters to tell the story, they’re 2 aliens, the green one and the red one, and another version with another pose to put it on the final.","details":"<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1amxtgXQkIH30w0w8KpaNEIAr8uTQiMJgvR-q-ZycEIc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1amxtgXQkIH30w0w8KpaNEIAr8uTQiMJgvR-q-ZycEIc/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>","dataRefs":[["NASA Logo","https://www.nasa.gov/history/symbols-of-nasa/"],["Spirit and Opportunity landing","https://science.nasa.gov/planetary-science/programs/mars-exploration/mission-timeline/how-we-land-on-mars/"]],"projectRefs":[["Exploration rover","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars_Exploration_Rover"]],"members":[{"name":"Renata Dueñas Enriquez","country":"Mexico","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Screenshot_2026-01-13_12.38.18.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":true},{"name":"Jesse Aiden Aguilar","country":"Mexico","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_20260622_142355_5qB2wzk.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"María Fernanda Rentería Miranda","country":"Mexico","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/moodboard_beabadoobee_CNb2Yai.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Jose Julian Remy Mendoza","count